// nearly all cached bytes were useful, so the next sweep can keep more of what it frees.
// Otherwise keep the cautious quarter: blocks left on inactive size lists cannot serve
// another size, and growing those took json-megabyte's peak from 214 to 361 MiB. The
// exhaustion check runs only here, with no new accounting on allocation or freeing.
