// BSD system calls themselves (#811: a macOS program should import as little of
// libSystem as it can). `ablaDarwinSyscall` is the BSD number and six arguments,
// the result -errno on failure (backend: bootstrapLlvmInlineDarwinSyscall).
// A Linux number this dispatcher does not handle goes to the C adapter
// (runtime/abla_darwin_compat.c), which keeps those cases until each group has
